The proposed system provides several features that can improve underground mine safety.

7.1 Real-Time Environmental Monitoring

The system continuously monitors important environmental parameters instead of depending only on periodic manual inspection.

7.2 Gas Leakage Detection

Gas sensors can identify the presence and concentration of dangerous gases and generate warnings when unsafe conditions are detected.

7.3 Worker Tracking

